# Architecture

**Canonical detail:** `docs/architecture.md`. When layering or integrations change, update **both** that document and this rule.

**dp1-publisher** is a SPA that publishes DP-1 documents to an external DP-1 Feed. **Vite embeds configuration at build time** via `import.meta.env` / `VITE_*`; no Node server in prod.

Flow (conceptual): `browser (React)` → **`src/lib/api.ts`** → **feed HTTP API** → backend persistence ([dp1-feed-v2](https://github.com/display-protocol/dp1-feed-v2)). Signing uses **wagmi/viem** (EIP-191) locally.

## Target layout (summary)

| Area | Location | Role |
|------|----------|------|
| **Entry / shell** | `src/main.tsx`, `src/App.tsx` | React root, wagmi/query providers |
| **Screens** | `src/components/` | Compose publish flows (`Dashboard`, forms) |
| **Feed client** | `src/lib/api.ts` | Paths, verbs, typed errors (`FeedAPIError`) |
| **Signing** | `src/lib/signing.ts`, payloads | Strip signatures → JCS → digest → EIP-191 |
| **Merge / wire helpers** | `src/lib/dp1Merge.ts`, `dp1EntityWire.ts` | Patch shapes aligned with server expectations |
| **Extension policy** | `src/context/`, `src/lib/dp1ExtensionPolicy.ts` | Extensions on/off UX vs `GET /api/v1` |
| **Types** | `src/types/dp1.ts` | DP-1-aligned shapes |

## Boundary rules

- **Components:** orchestrate user intent; delegate IO to `lib/`.
- **`api.ts`:** HTTP only for feed calls — no DP-1 signing or wallet access.
- **Signing modules:** deterministic inputs; isolate wallet/async concerns clearly.
- **Types:** shared shapes across UI + `lib/`; tighten when responses are known stable.

## Build / deploy

- `npm run build` → **`dist/`** static assets behind nginx/CDN (`Dockerfile` pattern).
- **Secrets:** never ship non-`VITE_*` server secrets — they belong in infra, not browser bundles.

## External contract

- Normative REST contract: **[dp1-feed-v2](https://github.com/display-protocol/dp1-feed-v2)** [api/openapi.yaml](https://github.com/display-protocol/dp1-feed-v2/blob/main/api/openapi.yaml) + [docs/api_design.md](https://github.com/display-protocol/dp1-feed-v2/blob/main/docs/api_design.md). This SPA implements **a subset**.

